5463 13194139536082 true] [17592186382677 1100 "Given that\n$B=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & -5 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 1 \\\\ y & 2 & 1\\end{aligned}]$\nand $det(B)=12,$ find the value of $y.$" 13194139536082 true] [17592186382677 1113 #uuid "6a11fa43-6c7e-5600-9b6b-53466b56fa48" 13194139536082 true] [17592186382677 1145 "Let's use our formula to find an expression for the determinant in terms of $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{det}(B) & =|\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & -5 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 1 \\\\ y & 2 & 1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =1|\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}|-2|\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 \\\\ y & 1\\end{aligned}|-5|\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 \\\\ y & 2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =0-2\\cdot (1-y)-5\\cdot (2-2y) \\\\  & =12y-12\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince the determinant of the matrix is $12,$ we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}12y-12 & =12 \\\\ 12y & =24 \\\\ y & =2\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536082 true] [17592186382678 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382679 13194139536082 true] [17592186382678 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382680 13194139536082 true] [17592186382678 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382681 13194139536082 true] [17592186382678 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382682 13194139536082 true] [17592186382678 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382683 13194139536082 true] [17592186382678 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536082 true] [17592186382678 1041 "selection" 13194139536082 true] [17592186382678 1104 #edb/ref 17592186382683 13194139536082 true] [17592186382678 1110 #uuid "04e27527-4ac1-5c1c-91d9-a7ed3ee291c7" 13194139536082 true] [17592186382679 1034 "13" 13194139536082 true] [17592186382679 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536082 true] [17592186382679 1111 #uuid "ba948d9a-0adb-5139-b992-7e3ef6211177" 13194139536082 true] [17592186382680 1034 "-8" 13194139536082 true] [17592186382680 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536082 true] [17592186382680 1111 #uuid "c4dbae3e-5235-57a9-9aa9-f81a548c19fa" 13194139536082 true] [17592186382681 1034 "-5" 13194139536082 true] [17592186382681 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139