6382685 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382689 13194139536082 true] [17592186382685 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382690 13194139536082 true] [17592186382685 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536082 true] [17592186382685 1041 "selection" 13194139536082 true] [17592186382685 1104 #edb/ref 17592186382688 13194139536082 true] [17592186382685 1110 #uuid "726c649d-a64b-570b-a9ab-126c08e00ae0" 13194139536082 true] [17592186382686 1034 "$-5$ and $-3$ only" 13194139536082 true] [17592186382686 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139536082 true] [17592186382686 1111 #uuid "53d6979c-b8d7-57d1-9f38-f4a05a09e7d3" 13194139536082 true] [17592186382687 1034 "$5$ and $3$ only" 13194139536082 true] [17592186382687 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139536082 true] [17592186382687 1111 #uuid "e4b8eb22-16db-5bab-8316-457b57a2c976" 13194139536082 true] [17592186382688 1034 "$-8$ and $-1$ only" 13194139536082 true] [17592186382688 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139536082 true] [17592186382688 1111 #uuid "a1a82094-bf6c-5d9c-afc6-58825a1ac5dd" 13194139536082 true] [17592186382689 1034 "$8$ and $3$ only" 13194139536082 true] [17592186382689 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139536082 true] [17592186382689 1111 #uuid "ed49e64d-0484-58a6-8db9-8f727d6e97d4" 13194139536082 true] [17592186382690 1034 "$7$ only" 13194139536082 true] [17592186382690 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139536082 true] [17592186382690 1111 #uuid "fa20b06c-807e-5188-a281-2600af857b24" 13194139536082 true] [17592186382691 1017 #edb/ref 17592186382692 13194139536082 true] [17592186382691 1017 #edb/ref 17592186382694 13194139536082 true] [17592186382691 1089 "q-280540" 13194139536082 true] [17592186382691 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139536082 true] [17592186382691 1100 "Given that the determinant of $[\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}-2 & 3 & 0 \\\\ x & -2 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 4 & 0\\end{aligned}]$ is $32$, find all the possible values of $x$ **in ascending order**.\n\nIn ascending order, $x=$\n{{field-1}} and $x=$\n{{field-2}}." 13194139536082 true] [17592186382691 1113 #uuid "91bf5b01-bba4-5542-be99-561e28debf43" 13194139536082 true] [17592186382691 1145 "Let’s use our formula to find an expression for the determinant in terms of $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(A) & =|\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}-2 & 3 & 0 \\\\ x & -2 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 4 & 0\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =({x}^{2}-2)|\\begin{aligned}-2 & -1 \\\\ 4 & 0\\end{aligned}|-3|\\begin{aligned}x & -1 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}|+0 \\\\  & =({x}^{2}-2)(-2\\cdot 0-(-1)(4))-3(x\\cdot 0-(-1)(1)) \\\\  & =({x}^{2}-2)(4)-3(1) \\\\  & =4{x}^{2}-8-3 \\\\  & =4{x}^{2}-11\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince the determinant of the matrix is $32$, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4{x}^{2}-11 & =32 \\\\ 4{x}^{2} & =43 \\\\ {x}^{2} & =\\frac{43}{4} \\\\ x & =\\pm \\sqrt{\\frac{43}{4}} \\\\  & =\\pm \\frac{\\sqrt{43}}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, **in ascending order**, the solutions are $x=-\\frac{\\sqrt{43}}{2}$ and $x=\\frac{\\sqrt{43}}{2}.$" 13194139536082 true] [17592186382692 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382693 13194139536082 true] [17592186382692 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139536082 true] [17592186382692 1041 "field-1" 13194139536082 true] [17592186382692 1104 #edb/ref 17592186382693 13194139536082 true] [17592186382692 1110 #uuid "b33d7a95-31e3-59e7-baff-78a70fb87d69" 13194139536082 true] [17592186382693 1034 "-\\frac{\\sqrt{43}}{2}" 13194139536082 true] [17592186382693 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536082 true] [17592186382693 1111 #uuid "fbfce83b-d77a-539f-a673-3c1b57d43754" 13194139536082 true] [17592186382694 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382695 13194139536082 true] [17592186382694 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139536082 true] [17592186382694 1041 "field-2" 13194139536082 true] [17592186382694 1104 #edb/ref 17592186382695 13194139536082 true] [17592186382694 1110 #uuid "ed8b1ec8-ea6a-55e7-a205-8e82e5998c39" 13194139536082 true] [17592186382695 1034 "\\frac{\\sqrt{43}}{2}" 13194139536082 true] [17592186382695 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536082 true] [1759218638269